      "id": 475535,
      "username": "Andru",
      "name": null,
      "created_at": "2025-07-28T17:51:56.445Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There’s an easier way. Hover your mouse over the Keycloak button, and it will show the URL that Keycloak uses. Just create a redirect in nginx from <a href=\"https://erp.example.com/#login\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://erp.example.com/#login</a> to that target URL. This way, anyone who accesses your ERPNext will be taken directly to Keycloak as the sole access point.</p>",
